        "content": {
          "kind": "markdown",
          "value": "# Start here\n\n1. Select **Fragment Portal** and use **Expand**.\n2. Confirm the fragment contains **Received Handoff**.\n3. Select **Send Typed Handoff**, enable **Allow Mutations** if needed, and press **Run**.\n4. The receiver should display `Hello from the host graph`; the Script result should contain a `delivered` envelope."
        },
